// Development workspace.
//
// The gg backend, the window backend, the opt-in GPU tier and the Arrow adapter
// are separate modules so that importing figure's core keeps a stdlib-only
// dependency graph. During development they are built together from this
// workspace; released builds resolve the core through the require directive in
// each nested module's go.mod.
go 1.25.0

use (
	.
	./arrow/v18
	./backend/gg
	./backend/gg/gpu
	./backend/window
)

// The nested modules require github.com/timzifer/figure v0.8.0, which does not
// exist until this repository's first tags are pushed. Until then the module
// graph cannot be resolved from the requirements alone, so the workspace names
// the two in-repo modules explicitly. Remove both lines once v0.8.0 and
// backend/gg/v0.8.0 are tagged.
replace github.com/timzifer/figure v0.8.0 => ./

replace github.com/timzifer/figure/backend/gg v0.8.0 => ./backend/gg
